## Audit Dimensions (10)
1. Dead code (unused exports)
2. ADR violations (44 ADRs)
3. Conflicting areas (duplicated logic, file vs DB)
4. Drift (comment vs behavior, claim vs reality)
5. Type safety (any, ts-ignore)
6. Dependency hygiene (.js extensions, circular deps)
7. Documentation pollution
8. Memory V2 coherence
9. Config integrity (URI schema, mime types)
10. Migration triage classification

## Approach
1. Read server.ts entry
2. Read each resource module
3. Cross-check resources/index.ts vs server registration
4. Grep for anti-patterns (any, .md parsing, sync I/O)
5. Author single audit report

